Subject: [PATCH] downloads: repair background ownership and per-item recovery

Download-owned streaming keep-alive and persistent per-item pause/resume/restart with network-only speed. Shared audio/speed helpers are byte-identical to Anikku 0112; image pages retain their own recovery path.
